      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just hard because there’s no actual \"problem\" to fix. i can’t tell my partner \"hey, i’m miserable for no reason\" without feeling like a complete jerk. and there's no end in sight, it's just this constant, heavy nothingness. sometimes i just sit there and think about how much easier it would be if i wasn't even here to feel the grayness. if everything just... stopped.",
